### Platform

Built on .NET 8 / WPF / Windows SDK (Microsoft, MIT-licensed runtime components). Windows is a trademark of Microsoft Corporation.

VSS snapshots are created through the WMI `Win32_ShadowCopy` interface (part of the Windows SDK / .NET `System.Management`), not a third-party VSS wrapper — there is no AlphaVSS dependency. The UI uses stock WPF with project-local styles, not ModernWpf.

Full license texts of MIT / Apache-2.0 / MS-RL dependencies are available in the respective packages; summary texts are linked from the NuGet package pages.
